            <div xml:id="d789">

                <pb facs="1149" n="1017" sameAs="frus:frus1926v01/pg1017"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.A4d/126: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1926-02-23T19:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 23,
                                1926—7 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>46. I am temporarily withholding reply of the Department in view of urgent
                    request of Chinese Minister for delay. He hopes to obtain permission shortly to
                    withdraw note. I expect to be able, if he succeeds, to authorize you to return
                    the note from the Foreign Office unanswered.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
